<p>You know that &quot;atomic number that ends in 8&quot; and &quot;atomic number that ends in 7&quot; are base-dependent, yeah? Whether something's a <em>multiple</em> of 8 isn't base-dependent, but whether its <em>last digit</em> is 8, is. That screws up whatever logic you're implying here.</p>

